{'symbol': 'AMCR', 'date': '2022-06-09 08:05:00', 'title': 'SUSANA SUAREZ GONZALEZ JOINS AMCOR AS CHIEF HUMAN RESOURCES OFFICER', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL. , JUNE 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMCOR (NYSE: AMCR; ASX: AMC)\xa0ANNOUNCED TODAY THE APPOINTMENT OF SUSANA SUAREZ GONZALEZ AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF HUMAN RESOURCES OFFICER, EFFECTIVE JUNE 13, 2022.'}